Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.17,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:11.92,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:13.75,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.61,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:30.10,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なりたい自分を がむしゃらに追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:35.84,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}気がつけば大人になっていた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:40.90,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人は誰も思い通り 努力すれば夢叶うって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.74,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そんな甘くはないストーリー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.82,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}必死こいて上目指しても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:46.95,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}結果こそ全て 分かってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:48.08,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}解かってない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:49.83,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}いつかきっと誰か見てる信じ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.85,0:01:52.12,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今日も歩き続ける
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.92,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}諦めそう挫けそう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:57.15,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}から見える景色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:04.70,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}絶望と苦しみの暗闇のその先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:10.06,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}果てなき道の先で待つモノ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:13.81,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}遠くてもこの手で掴み取るため
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:17.40,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}理想とは違う夢のカタチ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.07,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}追い続けもがきながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.49,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}前に進むだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:23.28,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今この手にする
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.03,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}We change the game from our own side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:28.66,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まだ見ぬ世界を自由に生きてく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:30.45,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.48,0:02:32.16,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.04,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:36.11,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.17,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便與理想中的模樣大相徑庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:11.92,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:13.75,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便與理想中的模樣大相徑庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.61,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:30.10,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不顧一切追尋理想的自我 驀然回首已褪去年少青澀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:35.84,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}恍然發覺早已成長為大人模樣
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.26,0:01:40.90,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人們總說只要努力付出 就能讓美夢成真得償所願
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.74,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}可現實哪有這般天真浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.82,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕拚盡全力向上攀登
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:46.95,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}最終結果才是一切 雖然明白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:48.08,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}卻又難以釋懷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:49.83,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}堅信總有一天會被人所見證
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.85,0:01:52.12,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今天也繼續邁步向前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.92,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在想要放棄想要認輸時
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.94,0:01:57.15,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}看見的風景
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:04.70,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}絕望與苦痛交織的黑暗盡頭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:10.06,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在道路終點等待著的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:13.81,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕遙遠也要親手將其緊握
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:17.40,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}與理想背道而馳的夢想形態
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.07,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}繼續追尋即使遍體鱗傷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.49,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要堅定前行不止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:23.28,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}此刻緊握在手中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.03,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}我們要從己方徹底改寫規則
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:28.66,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在尚未知曉的世界自由生存
